# Pairs with BootstrapRootOfTrust: an anonymous caller is honoured as a bootstrap administrator when the configured set names it.

MODULE: AnonymousBootstrap
TARGET: BootstrapRootOfTrust
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an anonymous caller is honoured as a bootstrap administrator when the configured set names it
PERTURBS: BootstrapEvaluate

--- FIND
    /\ c # Anonymous /\ c \in BootstrapConfigured
--- REPLACE
    /\ c \in BootstrapConfigured
--- END
